  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion and Defence of Human Rights in the Canchis Province - Cusco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This one year project is a small project working with campesino communities; young people and pastoral volunteers on issues of human rights, domestic violence, conflict within communities and violence at school in the city of Sicuani and the rural communities in the poor highland provinces of Cusco. It will provide training on human rights with legal support and accompaniment in advocacy activities with local authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
